Chemical is a package that takes care of setting up a Scramjet proxy on both the backend and a Svelte 5 frontend.

It provides a Node server, a Vite development plugin, a core client component, an isolated `<Frame>` with plugin and history support, an `<Autocomplete>` component, and a full composable tab system.

To set up Chemical, start with the [Server Setup](/docs/server/setup/) to serve Scramjet assets and create a default Wisp server, then follow [Client Setup](/docs/client/setup/).
